scb players add #valter_rose data 1
fn vg:script/side/valter_rose
tag @p[team=player] add valter_rose

ex if score #valter_rose data 1 run advancement @a vg:valter_rose/1
ex if score #valter_rose data 3 run advancement @a vg:valter_rose/3
ex if score #valter_rose data 5 run advancement @a vg:valter_rose/5
ex if score #valter_rose data 8 run advancement @a vg:valter_rose/8
ex if score #valter_rose data 10 run advancement @a vg:valter_rose/10
